Q9 & Q10: S3 Triggers

Note: Go to the "Add Trigger" button in the Lambda UI and select your S3 bucket.
Python

def lambda_handler(event, context):
    # Extract data from the S3 event object
    record = event['Records'][0]['s3']
    bucket = record['bucket']['name']
    file_name = record['object']['key']
    file_size = record['object']['size']
    
    print(f"File: {file_name} | Bucket: {bucket} | Size: {file_size} bytes")
    return "S3 Event Processed"

